<http://data.silknow.org/event/6bb6fb5c-25a7-3642-9124-cf10d562c148>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "1883 Register Entry: 'DRESS PIECE (Sari). Red cotton net, every third thread of the warp is of yellow silk. The side borders are striped in yellow, red, white, and green silk. The end borders are in bands of red and white silk with a short fringe. Burhampore. 19th cent. L. 25 ft. 8 in., W. 3 ft. 9 in. Bought 1 pound 5 shillings. 1702 (IS) 1883.'"@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/ed9ff813-08b8-30b5-9f6d-debfcdf3941b> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "1883 Register Entry: 'DRESS PIECE (Sari). Red cotton net, every third thread of the warp is of yellow silk. The side borders are striped in yellow, red, white, and green silk. The end borders are in bands of red and white silk with a short fringe. Burhampore. 19th cent. L. 25 ft. 8 in., W. 3 ft. 9 in. Bought 1 pound 5 shillings. 1702 (IS) 1883.'"@en .

